// The continent the parks stand on (WD-05, WD-19; docs/decisions/plan-world.md). One land and one island.
// Each region is one place on the map: its id, the name a player reads, and where it sits on a unit map
// (x 0 is the west coast, 1 the east; y 0 is the north, 1 the south). `island` marks the one region off
// the coast. A park names its region; no two parks share one, and a region with no park yet is waiting
// for its park file.
